 "intro_zh": "喀什地区帕米尔旅游区总面积3.1平方公里，由石头城景区、金草滩，塔吉克民俗村、综合服务中心、旅游购物中心五大区域组成，是古代丝绸之路南道、中道通往西亚、南亚及欧洲的必经之地。2014年被国家旅游局授予全国“国际高原风情旅游目的地”的称号。",
 "intro_en": "Kashgar Prefecture, also known as Kashi Prefecture, is a prefecture in southwestern Xinjiang, China, in the Tarim Basin region (roughly the southern half of Xinjiang). It has an area of 112,057 km2 (43,265 sq mi) and 4,496,377 inhabitants at the 2020 census with a population density of 35.5 inhabitants/km2. The capital of the prefecture is the city of Kashgar which has a population 506,640. Kashgar Prefecture borders the Gorno-Badakhshan Autonomous Region of Tajikistan, Badakhshan Province of Afghanistan, Gilgit-Baltistan of Pakistan, and Ladakh of India in the far south.",
 "intro_en_source": "wikipedia",
